& [Method]
  + decompose the user vision into sixteen identity authority inference custody fault resource provider and product coordinates
  + classify substrate and nested-system state independently so proved components never imply integrated completion
  + bind every classification to exact tracked evidence and one gap-specific next contract
  + hard-code the expected mapping separately in a read-only verifier and rederive evidence markers current provider unavailability counts and mapping digest
  + mutate the matrix evidence tracked state proof marker and provider-contact truth in one removed disposable Git repository

& [Result]
  + six coordinates have proved reusable substrate six have candidates two are historical and two have no substrate
  + no coordinate proves a nested outer-inner system
  + the smallest safe successor is contract formation beginning with outer host identity rather than provider launch or new model exploration

& [NonAuthority]
  + analysis verification and navigation only
  + no canonical nested-host specification is signed and no runtime process provider model effect persistence remote FPGA or Minecraft action occurs
